// artifact.manual_revision — provenance of a revision made by restoring another.
// artifact_revisions.restored_from int [note: 'revision_number of the same item_id this revision copied; null for agent or hand-edited revisions. Hand-made revisions set created_by_user_id and leave request_id null']
// ArtifactRevision.author (API) is derived, not stored: 'assistant' when request_id is set, 'user' otherwise. Undo (DELETE …/revisions/{n}) removes only the current 'user' revision younger than 10 minutes.
//
// chat.share — conversations are device-local, so a share stores its own snapshot.
